en-pos.bin is Writing check's part-of-speech tagger: averaged-perceptron
weights trained by tools/writing-tagger/train.py on the Universal Dependencies
English Web Treebank (UD_English-EWT, commit
4a4d77f599ea53cc405f85d0cec4b2f14f81d42b, https://github.com/UniversalDependencies/UD_English-EWT),
which is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
International licence (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/).

The model is an adaptation of that treebank and is distributed under the same
licence, CC BY-SA 4.0. Changes: the treebank's words and Penn Treebank tags were
re-split into Writing check's tokens, copied in lower case, without final
punctuation and with one verb put in the wrong agreement or form, and learned
into hashed int16 weights. The app's source code is not affected by this
licence; only this file is.
